		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Copperish sphere the size of a dinner plate. Filled with whirring gears, has six spindly spider legs. Used for spycraft, records audio onto precious gemstones.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 2, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +0 (1), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 0</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Record</strong>. Record or play back audio within near using a gem worth 50 GP or more (must be slotted into spy).</p><p></p><p><strong>Stealthy</strong>. ADV on checks to sneak and hide.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
